         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Philosophizing\n\nAccording to Plato, Socrates once said that ===he did not know, and he did not think he knew===.\n\nThis fact makes us think.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "cb8d0c30-1698-430d-9023-0a52aca7dc52",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1
      },
      {
         "id": "cb8d0c30-1698-430d-9023-0a52aca7dc52",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "81e9393b-d5b6-4b04-91bd-417e943d3e97",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=2a2cbd69-7f09-4a58-aff1-6fbff8c5bda5",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2025",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "When Socrates made this statement, did he understand that we cannot know all things?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "7ca84a61-9912-4004-b07e-f44a19fbdaa4",
         "prev": "c69673be-0a59-4235-a83e-0f2d26e13ede",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "Yes",
         "score": 2
      },
      {
         "id": "7ca84a61-9912-4004-b07e-f44a19fbdaa4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Motivation\n\nSocrates reached this conclusion thousands of years ago. It should not make us feel bad. On the contrary, it should encourage us. As we learn, we find out that there is always more to learn.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
